  <Lines>k__BackingField:
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4db0d9531338cfe4ea4e57a3339c89c1, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d35d0e1530830e42b12a5e80d0329dc, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "Ah bon ? C\u2019est peut \xEAtre \xE0 cause de la fois ou j\u2019ai dit aux
      autres qu\u2019il s\u2019\xE9tait fait dessus la premi\xE8re nuit."
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4db0d9531338cfe4ea4e57a3339c89c1, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f0358eca1d351f540a61dc689202b2b8, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "Mais c\u2019est m\xEAme pas vrai, je pensais pas que \xE7a le vexerais."
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d57cec67bb2a1a945ada3b66d3cb9bf5, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 15a032d1f64921b49a6cec6c0a26887d, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "C\u2019est peut \xEAtre que c\u2019est vrai alors\u2026\r\n"
